$ jailops image build freebsd-15 --from-generation 1
generation/freebsd-15#g4 built

$ jailops image build freebsd-15 --from-generation freebsd-15#g2 --dry-run
dry-run: would build freebsd-15#g5 (120 packages)

$ jailops image build freebsd-15 --from-generation other#g2
! usage: --from-generation: "other#g2" belongs to image other, not freebsd-15
! hint: run 'jailops image build --help' for usage
[exit 2]

$ jailops image generation delete -y freebsd-15 g3
generation/freebsd-15#g3 deleted

$ jailops image generation delete -y freebsd-15 three
! usage: GENERATION must be a generation such as g2, not "three"
! hint: run 'jailops image generation delete --help' for usage
[exit 2]

